# n1 is 60 tall on a 100 min-width layer; n2 is exactly 100 and legal.
# n1 and n2 are also too close for spacing, but `check` restricts the run to width.
case minimum_width
die 0 0 10000 10000
routing M1 dir=H pitch=200 spacing=90 min_width=100
cut V1
result n1 M1 0 0 1000 60
result n2 M1 0 100 1000 200
check minimum_width
expect minimum_width M1 0 0 1000 60 nets=n1 required=100
